{# Coverage fragment — lazy-loaded via htmx from ``GET /categorizers/progress``,
   deferred off the main ``/categorizers`` page's initial paint (loaded with
   ``hx-swap="none"``). It does NOT render a standalone section: each row
   (keyed by categorizer name) emits a pair of htmx out-of-band (``hx-swap-oob``)
   elements that patch the matching placeholder cells already sitting in the
   main inventory table (``id="lastproc-<name>"`` / ``id="cov-<name>"``) — one
   response, one full-table scan, N rows patched in place. Every ``done``/
   ``total`` pair is its own independent full-table aggregate scan, so this
   stays deferred the same way ``/status/backlog`` defers the chunk-pipeline
   panel (see that fragment's docstring/comments for the rationale).

   ``done`` = chunks (axis) or refs (ref-level axis / topic marker) already
   carrying the categorizer's tag; ``total`` = its eligible universe (body
   chunks for a chunk-level axis; the paper+patent corpus for a ref-level axis
   or a topic). A dormant ("not wired") categorizer correctly reads 0% — no
   pass has ever run to write its tag. ``error: true`` = the count query itself
   failed (schema drift); rendered as a dash rather than a misleading 0%. #}
{% for name, row in progress.items() %}
<span id="lastproc-{{ name }}" hx-swap-oob="true" class="w-24 shrink-0 text-right text-slate-400 tabular-nums" title="last tag written">{% if row.last_minted %}{{ row.last_minted | ago }}{% else %}<span class="text-slate-400">never</span>{% endif %}</span>
<div id="cov-{{ name }}" hx-swap-oob="true" class="mt-1 pl-32 pr-2">
  {% if row.error %}
  <span class="text-[11px] text-rose-600">(coverage query failed — see logs)</span>
  {% else %}
  {% set total = row.total|default(0) %}{% set done = row.done|default(0) %}
  {% set pct = ((done / total) * 100) if total > 0 else 100 %}
  {% set pct_pend = (100 - pct) if total > 0 else 0 %}
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
    <span class="w-32 shrink-0 tabular-nums" title="{{ '{:,}'.format(total) }} eligible">{{ '{:,}'.format(done) }} / {{ '{:,}'.format(total) }}</span>
    <div class="flex-1 h-2 rounded bg-slate-100 overflow-hidden flex" title="done {{ '{:,}'.format(done) }} · pending {{ '{:,}'.format(total - done) }}">
      <div class="h-2 bg-emerald-500" style="width: {{ '%.1f'|format(pct) }}%"></div>
      <div class="h-2 bg-sky-500" style="width: {{ '%.1f'|format(pct_pend) }}%"></div>
    </div>
    <span class="w-14 text-right tabular-nums">{{ '%.1f'|format(pct) }}%</span>
    {% if 'hit_count' in row %}<span class="w-24 text-right text-slate-400 shrink-0 tabular-nums" title="refs carrying topic:{{ name }}">{{ '{:,}'.format(row.hit_count|default(0)) }} hits</span>{% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
{% endfor %}
